OL,3,ATrump shakes hands with Putin and Xi
OL,4,Aahead of historic talks in China
OL,5,
OL,6,FDonald Trump and Vladimir Putin met for
OL,7,Fthe first time in more than a year on
OL,8,FWednesday, as they prepared for
OL,9,Flandmark talks in China with Xi
OL,10,FJinping.
OL,12,FThe US president was greeted off his
OL,13,Fplane by the Chinese leader as he
OL,14,Farrived in Shenzhen for a summit of
OL,15,FAsia-Pacific leaders, which will
OL,16,Fculminate in a closely-watched meeting
OL,17,Fbetween the pair and the Russian
OL,18,Fpresident.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
